>Cosgrove</surname><given-names>DO</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Initial observations on the effect of irradiation on the liver-specific uptake of Levovist</article-title><source>Eur J Radiol</source><year>2002</year><volume>41</volume><fpage>192</fpage><lpage>199</lpage><comment>PM: 11861093</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11861093</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0720-048X(01)00458-2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Heckemann</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Harvey</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Blomley</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Eckersley</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Butler-Barnes</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Jayaram</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Cosgrove</surname><given-names>DO</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Enhancement characteristics of the microbubble agent Levovist: reproducibility and interaction with aspirin</article-title><source>Eur J Radiol</source><year>2002</year><volume>41</volume><fpage>179</fpage><lpage>183</lpage><comment>PM:11861091</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11861091</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0720-048X(01)00460-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jones</surname><given-names>EA</given-names></name><name><surname>Summerfield</surname><given-names>JA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Functional aspects of hepatic sinusoidal cells</article-title><source>Semin Liver Dis</source><year>1985</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>157</fpage><lpage>74</lpage><comment>PM: 3161182</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3161182</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Iijima</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Moriyasu</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Miyahara</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Yanagisawa</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Ultrasound contrast agent, Levovist microbubbles are phagocytosed by Kupffer cells-In vitro and in vivo studies</article-title><source>Hepatol Res</source><year>2006</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>235</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><comment>PM: 16831566</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16831566</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.hepres.2006.04.016</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>